{'symbol': 'SCHW', 'date': '2022-11-07 14:25:00', 'title': 'CHARLES SCHWAB FOUNDATION MAKES NEARLY $600,000 IN GRANTS AND SCHOLARSHIPS TO SUPPORT FINANCIAL LITERACY IN DALLAS-FORT WORTH', 'text': 'WESTLAKE, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BUILDING ON ITS DECADES-LONG COMMITMENT TO FINANCIAL LITERACY, CHARLES SCHWAB COMMEMORATED THE ONE-YEAR ANNIVERSARY OF ITS SIGNATURE FINANCIAL EDUCATION PROGRAM, MONEYWISE AMERICA™, BY WELCOMING 220 UPLIFT EDUCATION STUDENTS TO ITS WESTLAKE HEADQUARTERS FOR AN ALL-DAY FINANCIAL LITERACY FIELD TRIP AND SURPRISING STUDENTS WITH A $1,000 SCHOLARSHIP TO SUPPORT POST-SECONDARY EDUCATION OPPORTUNITIES.'}{'symbol': 'SCHW', 'date': '2022-11-07 09:00:00', 'title': 'SCHWAB TO AGAIN HOST THE CHARLES SCHWAB CUP CHAMPIONSHIP AT PHOENIX COUNTRY CLUB, ITS 19TH YEAR AS SPONSOR OF THE EVENT', 'text': 'WESTLAKE, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CHARLES SCHWAB ANNOUNCES PRIZE FOR THE 2022 CHARLES SCHWAB CUP WINNER.'}